Hello

This works on V5.1

Add the following lines to /etc/inet.local

Note:  my devices were ee1 and ee3

ifconfig ee1 down
ifconfig ee3 down
ifconfig nr0 add ee1,ee3
ifconfig nr0 your ip-address netmask 255.255.255.0

Reboot or rcinet restart (careful if your on a cluster)

